  "checked": "25 finalists named by Tuttosport on 5 Oct 2026, eight in the Premier League (Africa Soccer full list; Emisoras Unidas, Real Madrid and PSG confirm names). Yamal (2024) and Doué (2025) not eligible as past winners (Flashscore, Sport.ua). Past winners Rooney 2004, Messi 2005, Haaland 2020, Bellingham 2023, Yamal 2024 (Wikipedia Golden Boy; Doué 2025 from Flashscore and Sport.ua). Winner not announced on 4 Nov; jury of journalists (Sport.ua, Wikipedia). Table after 9 games: Arsenal 24, City 21, Brighton 19, Chelsea 16, Liverpool 15, Brentford 14, Everton 13, Bournemouth 12 (NBC and Toffeeweb agree). PL goals to 2 Nov: Kostoulas 3, Vuskovic 1, Rayan 1; Kroupi, Estevao, Hato, Bouaddi, Lewis-Skelly not on the scorers list (NBC scoring list). Kostoulas came from Olympiacos and scored a late overhead kick v Bournemouth in Jan 2026 (Goal, Sports Mole, AP via WSLS). No game clip: his famous goal is an overhead kick, which the game footage cannot do. No 'you' anywhere; the rules are a game, not a prediction. Cubarsí heads the list (Emisoras Unidas, Excelsior).",
